      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      78.02,
      383.43,
      527.24,
      397.43
    ],
    "text": "to attend a feast held in Taniwella Devalaya. After the feast, they had all been",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      78.02,
      404.57,
      527.28,
      418.57
    ],
    "text": "served with food. After having food, all of them had gone home. When they",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      78.02,
      425.69,
      527.16,
      439.69
    ],
    "text": "were about to go home, her mother had given a food parcel to be given to her",
