      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      78.02,
      489.17,
      527.28,
      503.17
    ],
    "text": "given for her father. Although she had pleaded, the Appellant had not given",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      78.02,
      510.29,
      527.21,
      524.29
    ],
    "text": "it back to her. Afterwards, both of them had proceeded to her father\u2019s house",
